        { "id": "d", "text": "x = y^2 / 2 + 1" }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "c",
      "explanation": "y = sqrt(2x - 1). Square both sides: y^2 = 2x - 1. Add 1: y^2 + 1 = 2x. Divide by 2: x = (y^2 + 1)/2."
