        { "id": "d", "text": "x = (y + 1) / (y - 2)" }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "a",
      "explanation": "y(x - 2) = x + 1. xy - 2y = x + 1. xy - x = 1 + 2y. x(y - 1) = 2y + 1. x = (2y + 1)/(y - 1)."
